Joe? Well, I know you said it doesn't have to be retro, but if I'm talking about retro, I think it's RPG.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.840
Okay. Like JRPG, I guess.

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:26.760
Otherwise, I don't know.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.740
It's tough. I mean, maybe it's still RPG.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:40.220
I don't know. I think you have to go to the answer that you think about, you know, because it's like we all play all different kinds of genres, but the one that springs into your head is probably the one you play the most.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.040
And when you step out of retro, I think I have a harder time deciding.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:45.500
But a retro, I think it's definitely RPG.

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:53.940
I mean, right now I've just been in a really big, like grand strategy kick where I've been playing a lot of like paradox games.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.320
I know that has this is a far cry from what we've been doing recently.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.820
I can't wait to play a 4X NES game.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:03.000
Yeah, like I've been playing Crusader Kings and Stellaris.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:08.640
And between that and the other thing, I've been playing like Western RPGs.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.200
Yeah. Stuff like that.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:14.780
So you're more of a you really like that large scale strategy stuff, but like Civ too, no?

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:20.160
Yeah, like Civ. Civ's more board gamey, but I think it's still got the same.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.840
It's got it's in the same family tree.

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.380
Same. I feel like I don't know.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:30.280
I kind of like just individual games more than genres.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.900
I kind of lean more towards FPS games and racing games, I think.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:37.440
But I mean, I play Smash Bros probably more than anything else.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:45.040
You know, Smash Bros and like going back and playing through the old Halos again are pretty much most of big Halo guy.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:49.800
Like not as big as you think, like not multiplayer because I didn't have Xbox Live when I was growing up.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.000
So just kind of just playing through that.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.620
Yeah. Just like the solo missions over and over and knowing where everything is.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.720
Yeah. My friend, my roommate got Game Pass, Microsoft Game Pass.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.340
So I'm playing through Halo 5 right now.

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.920
Very different, but still enjoyable.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:10.460
And for me, there's there's just something about JRPGs that I default to.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.480
Like I really like platformers.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:16.680
And that's like something I didn't even recognize until like even just games like Rayman Origins.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.240
