00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:47.220
That I'm just like, you know, I'm hyped to know that those still exist.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.800
And it's probably going to be a never ending journey for me.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.480
Just there's a little bit of a tangent.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:56.800
I really want to play Vagrant Story as well because I just love the aesthetic that I see in it.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:01.560
