00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:02.540
I know it's not going to be perfect.

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.040
I've heard that it's I've heard that it's a lot clunkier playing it today.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.840
Yeah. Like the combat system, you know, it's one of those unique ones again.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.140
But then again, you're a guy that likes Final Fantasy VIII.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.820
So and I'm not saying that that's wrong.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.140
I'm just saying like people have a huge problem with that combat system.

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:19.040
I see. So I know is a rare.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.340
Anyway, that's that.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:21.860
Yep. Anyway. But like, thanks.

