00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:08.860
Mach Rider takes place in the year 2112, probably because of Rush.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:14.900
And planet Earth has been invaded by evil forces driving vehicles known as quad runners.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:18.820
The player controls Mach Rider, or if you're Joe, just you.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:28.680
Mach Rider travels from sector to sector on a high powered super bike, searching for survivors and destroying any enemies in his path.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.700
Gotta say, I haven't seen any survivors.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.940
If you did, you shot them.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:40.180
Yeah, it's funny how like in some levels, there's just like those destroyed buildings in the background that you're driving towards.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.060
And it's like, it doesn't look great.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.280
It doesn't look good over there.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.400
I don't know if I would be heading in a great direction.

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:46.580
Maybe just skip that city.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:52.120
I mean, the good thing about the apocalypse is there's tons of gas on the side of the road, you know, to refill your car.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:57.100
Yeah. And this comes at like, you know, the peak of the 80s blockbuster and that action era.

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.180
I go right to Mad Max with this.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:06.120
Oh, yeah. But does anybody else feel like any other action movies or allusions to anything else?

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.420
I mean, yeah, kind of just a blend.

00:08:08.740 --> 00:08:11.320
I think a blend is more of my perception of it.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:14.080
Anyways, I didn't really watch a lot of those movies, but it just feels like.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.860
