00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:20.120
I think it also like Tron just because of the movie.

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:28.980
Yeah, the light bike. I think it's definitely a combination because while it definitely feels like Mad Max, he never rode a motorcycle.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.300
