00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:34.620
That's why I thought this felt like Mad Max the most.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.120
Like besides the whole like apocalypse thing and all that stuff.

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.240
I just thought like.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.520
Besides the whole setting.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:48.020
Besides the whole setting of that, I could swear I have like this image of Mel Gibson on a super bike or something.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.020
Nope. He had the he had that car.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.700
